title: "factwash"
abstract: "A write-time gate for AI memory: catches rewrites that wash hearsay into fact (dropped attribution, stripped hedges, reversed polarity, lost conditions and temporal scope, broken derivations). Deterministic core, evidence-validated optional witness, typed source-to-output change report."
